{"Categories":[10],"HiddenTopics":[26],"Topics":[],"Id":79,"TextResource":{"Name":"ocean-pacific","Translations":[{"Text":"Ocean Pacific","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"Ocean Pacific","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"3","Id":10}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>Para ver y verse mejor, además de proteger sus ojos del sol, lo ideal es tener lentes con estilo y de gran calidad, los que puede encontrar entre la gran variedad de diseños y marcas que Top Sol ofrece en cada una de sus tiendas en el aeropuerto.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>To look and see better, it’s not enough to protect your eyes from the sun; the ideal is to wear top quality style sunglasses, such as the large variety of designs and brands that Top Sol offers you in each of its airport shops.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916780","Updated":"1488916780","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/079_ocean-pacific.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":[]},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/079_ocean-pacific.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/79\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/079_ocean-pacific.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/79\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[{"key":"field_phone","label":"Phone","field_name":"field_shop_phone"},{"key":"field_shop_site_internet","label":"Website","field_name":"field_shop_site_internet"},{"key":"field_opening_hours","label":"Opening hours","field_name":"field_shop_openinghours"}]},"HasAdditionalInfo":true}